{"Title":"An Act increasing the age limit for retired police officers serving as special police officers in the town of Weston","BillNumber":"H4987","DocketNumber":"HD5278","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-29T15:00:09.53"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-29T15:00:09.53"},{"Id":"MJB0","Name":"Michael J. Barrett","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJB0","ResponseDate":"2024-07-29T15:02:41.97"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"MJB0","Name":"Michael J. Barrett","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJB0","ResponseDate":"2024-07-29T15:00:09.53"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4987/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peisch of Wellesley and Senator Barrett, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4987) of Alice Hanlon Peisch and Michael J. Barrett (by vote of the town) relative to increasing the age limit for retired police officers serving as special police officers in the town of Weston.  Public Service.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 74 of the acts of 2020, An Act Providing for the Appointment of Retired Police Officers as Special Police Officers in the Town of Weston, is hereby amended by striking out in section 7 the number \"65\" in both instances in which it appears and inserting in place thereof the number:- 70.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}